    "title": "Alex Thorn: 50-Week Signal Says Bitcoin’s Bottom is In",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/alex-thorn-50-week-signal-says-bitcoins-bottom-is-in",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
