    "description": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pxkmrktEnZE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/pxkmrktEnZE/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Alex-Thorn-50-Week-Signal-Says-Bitcoins-Bottom-is-In-.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/alex-thorn-50-week-signal-says-bitcoins-bottom-is-in\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex Thorn: 50-Week Signal Says Bitcoin&#8217;s Bottom is In</a></p>\n<p>Galaxy's Alex Thorn calls the Bitcoin bottom, pointing to the 50-week moving average reclaim, resilience at $80K, and why being long is now contrarian.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/alex-thorn-50-week-signal-says-bitcoins-bottom-is-in\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex Thorn: 50-Week Signal Says Bitcoin&#8217;s Bottom is In</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
